# Good Film AI — Website Implementation Plan

## Context

**Good Film AI** (Summer Grace LLC) is a film/video production studio based in Silicon Valley with Hollywood/LA roots. The team is exploring AI Film — using Gen AI and AI Agents to empower filmmaking. They need a bilingual company showcase website.

**Domains:** goodfilm.ai, goodaifilm.com
**Core Clients:** Silicon Valley tech companies, tech conferences/expos, nonprofits
**Portfolio:** Robotics company videos, tech forums, ByteDance Trae launch event, nonprofit events, LA film/commercial work
**AI Film:** AI-generated films, AI Film Festivals participation, AI Agents in production workflows

---

## Tech Stack

- **Next.js 14+ (App Router)** + TypeScript
- **Tailwind CSS** with custom cinematic theme
- **next-intl** for EN/ZH bilingual support
- **Framer Motion** for scroll animations
- **React Hook Form + Zod** for contact form
- **Calendly** embed for booking
- **Vercel** for deployment

---

## Site Structure (Single-Page, 6 Sections)

| # | Section | Style | Purpose |
|---|---------|-------|---------|
| 1 | **Hero** | Dark cinematic | Tagline + CTA, full-viewport |
| 2 | **About** | Light clean | Company story, SV + Hollywood roots |
| 3 | **Services** | Light gray | 4-card grid of service offerings |
| 4 | **Portfolio** | White | 5 project showcase cards (placeholders) |
| 5 | **AI Film** | Dark cinematic | AI filmmaking vision + future direction |
| 6 | **Contact** | Light | Contact form + Calendly embed |

---

## File Structure

```
good_film_ai/
├── public/images/              # Placeholder images
├── src/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── [locale]/
│   │   │   ├── layout.tsx      # Locale layout with Header/Footer
│   │   │   └── page.tsx        # Assembles all 6 sections
│   │   ├── api/contact/route.ts # Contact form endpoint
│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root HTML layout
│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Redirect to /en
│   │   └── globals.css
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── layout/             # Header, Footer, Navigation
│   │   ├── sections/           # Hero, About, Services, Portfolio, AIFilm, Contact
│   │   ├── ui/                 # Button, Card, SectionHeading, ScrollReveal, LanguageSwitcher, CalendlyEmbed
│   │   └── forms/              # ContactForm
│   ├── i18n/                   # next-intl config (routing, request, navigation)
│   ├── messages/
│   │   ├── en.json             # English content
│   │   └── zh.json             # Chinese content
│   ├── lib/                    # constants, validators
│   └── types/                  # TypeScript interfaces
├── middleware.ts               # Locale detection
├── next.config.ts              # next-intl plugin
├── tailwind.config.ts          # Custom cinema theme
└── package.json
```

---

## Implementation Phases

### Phase 1: Foundation
1. Scaffold Next.js project with TypeScript + Tailwind
2. Install deps: `next-intl framer-motion react-hook-form @hookform/resolvers zod lucide-react`
3. Configure Tailwind custom theme (cinema colors, fonts, animations)
4. Set up next-intl (routing, middleware, message files)
5. Create types and constants

### Phase 2: Layout Shell
6. Build UI primitives (Button, Card, SectionHeading, ScrollReveal)
7. Build Header (sticky nav, language switcher EN/ZH, mobile hamburger)
8. Build Footer (company info, links, social)

### Phase 3: Sections
9. HeroSection — dark bg, tagline, 2 CTAs
10. AboutSection — company story, Hollywood + SV
11. ServicesSection — 4-card grid (Corporate Video, Event Coverage, Commercial, AI Production)
12. PortfolioSection — 5 project cards with placeholder images
13. AIFilmSection — dark section, AI film vision, festivals, AI agents in production
14. ContactSection — form + Calendly embed

### Phase 4: Polish
15. Contact form API route (validation, honeypot spam prevention)
16. Complete EN + ZH translation files
17. Responsive testing + mobile menu
18. Scroll animations + smooth scroll

---

## Key Design Decisions

- **Style:** Cinematic dark hero → clean professional sections → dark AI Film section → light contact. Creates visual rhythm.
- **Colors:** Deep blacks (#0a0a0a), subtle gold accent (#c9a84c) for Hollywood nod, tech blue (#4c6ef5) for CTAs
- **Fonts:** Inter (Latin) + Noto Sans SC (Chinese) via next/font
- **Content:** All placeholder text — real portfolio content added later
- **Calendly URL:** Placeholder, user provides real link later

---

## Verification

1. `npm run dev` — site loads at localhost:3000
2. Navigate to `/en` and `/zh` — both languages render correctly
3. Language switcher toggles between EN/ZH
4. All 6 sections visible with smooth scroll navigation
5. Contact form validates and submits to API route
6. Responsive: check mobile (375px), tablet (768px), desktop (1440px)
7. `npm run build` — no build errors
